Hi [Name],<br><br>
This week''s federal tariff support package includes extended loan terms, a lowered eligibility threshold for BDC programs, and new non-repayable funding for affected businesses. If your corporation touches any of the newly tariffed sectors, including steel, aluminum, dairy, appliances, agricultural equipment, pulp and paper, or electronics, several of these measures may apply directly to your financing.<br><br>
I would be glad to walk through which of the five programs fit your specific situation ahead of the September 8 effective date.<br><br>
[Your Name]<br><br>
<em>This communication is for educational purposes only and does not constitute personalized investment advice.</em>
</div>
